<view class="screen"><view class="eyebrow">WHALEU · 写下此刻</view><view class="title">{{frozen ? '确认原发布结果' : (isTrading ? '发布校园交易' : maxText === 500 ? '写一条评论' : '分享校园里的事')}}</view>
  <view class="subtitle">本地草稿与已提交内容分别保存。结果未确认前，原请求不会被修改或替换。</view>
  <view class="notice">显示身份选项不代表已取得发布资格或内容已获审核。可另行确认身份校区，内容审核提交流程尚未开放；发布不可用时，仍可查询本账号的原请求回执。</view>
  <view class="status" aria-role="status">{{status}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" aria-role="alert">{{error}}</view>
  <navigator wx:if="{{hasSession &amp;&amp; !busy &amp;&amp; canOpenIdentityCampus}}" class="link" url="/pages/identity-campus/identity-campus">查看身份校区状态与可选校区（返回后需再次点击发送）→</navigator>
  <view wx:if="{{hasSession}}" class="card"><view wx:if="{{recoveryOperation}}" class="meta">待确认类型：{{recoveryOperation}}</view><view wx:if="{{replyTargetName}}" class="scope">回复：{{replyTargetName}}</view><view class="label">正文 · 最多 {{maxText}} 字</view><textarea value="{{text}}" bindinput="onText" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="说说你想分享的事…" />
    <view class="scope">发送时展示：{{effectiveIdentity || '请等待当前身份权限检查'}}</view><view wx:if="{{!frozen &amp;&amp; !identityForced}}" class="chips"><view class="chip {{authorMode === 'named' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="named" bindtap="onMode">公开身份</view><view class="chip {{authorMode === 'anonymous' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="anonymous" bindtap="onMode">匿名</view></view>
    <view wx:if="{{canChooseAnonymousDm &amp;&amp; authorMode === 'named'}}" class="row"><text>允许别人通过此帖以分身私信我</text><switch checked="{{allowAnonymousDm}}" bindchange="onAllowAnonymousDm" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" /></view><view wx:if="{{canChooseAnonymousDm &amp;&amp; authorMode === 'named'}}" class="notice">此选择仅随本次帖子一同审核，个人默认偏好不会改变已发布帖子。</view>
    <view wx:if="{{canDisableComments &amp;&amp; !frozen}}" class="row"><text>限制普通评论</text><switch checked="{{commentsPolicy === 'restricted'}}" bindchange="onRestricted" disabled="{{busy}}" /></view>
    <view wx:if="{{isTrading}}" class="trading-composer">
      <view class="section-title">交易信息 · 仅公开身份、地区社区</view>
      <view class="chips"><button wx:for="{{tradingCategories}}" wx:key="key" class="chip {{tradingDraft.subtype === item.key ? 'active' : ''}}" data-key="{{item.key}}" bindtap="onTradingSubtype" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}">{{item.label}}</button></view>
      <view class="label">价格（元，大于零且不超过 99999）</view><input type="text" value="{{tradingDraft.price}}" data-field="price" bindinput="onTradingField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="如 12.345，不会四舍五入" />
      <view wx:if="{{tradingDraft.subtype !== 'qiugou'}}" class="chips"><button class="chip {{tradingDraft.urgency === 'urgent' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-key="urgent" bindtap="onTradingUrgency" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}">低价急出</button><button class="chip {{tradingDraft.urgency === 'normal' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-key="normal" bindtap="onTradingUrgency" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}">普通出售</button></view>
      <view class="notice">{{tradingDraft.subtype === 'qiugou' ? '求购使用普通模式' : '普通出售可进入普通社区浏览；急出在交易分类中浏览。急出群推送尚未接入'}}。售出／解决状态与急出模式互不影响。</view>
      <view class="label">交易地点／校区（必填）</view><input value="{{tradingDraft.location}}" data-field="location" bindinput="onTradingField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="手动填写，不使用身份校区代填" />
      <view class="label">自愿发布的联系方式（至少一项）</view>
      <input value="{{tradingDraft.wechat}}" data-field="wechat" bindinput="onTradingField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="微信" />
      <input value="{{tradingDraft.qq}}" data-field="qq" bindinput="onTradingField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="QQ" />
      <input value="{{tradingDraft.phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="onTradingField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="联系电话" />
      <view class="notice">以上联系方式会供有权查看此帖的用户展示和复制，不表示号码已认证。成功发布后会在本机当前账号下记住你填写的地点与整组联系方式，下次仍需确认公开。请勿填写他人的私密资料。这里不提供付款、担保、配送或交易订单。</view>
      <view class="row"><text>我愿意公开以上联系方式</text><switch checked="{{tradingDraft.contactConsent}}" bindchange="onContactConsent" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" /></view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{canAddPoll}}" class="poll-composer">
      <view class="row"><text>添加投票</text><switch checked="{{pollDraft.enabled}}" bindchange="onPollEnabled" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded || formationDraft.enabled}}" /></view>
      <view wx:if="{{pollDraft.enabled}}">
        <view class="label">独立投票问题 · 最多 255 字</view><input value="{{pollDraft.question}}" bindinput="onPollQuestion" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="你想问大家什么？" />
        <view class="chips"><button class="chip {{pollDraft.selectionMode === 'single' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="single" bindtap="onPollMode" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}">单选</button><button class="chip {{pollDraft.selectionMode === 'multiple' ? 'active' : ''}}" data-mode="multiple" bindtap="onPollMode" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}">多选</button></view>
        <view wx:for="{{pollDraft.options}}" wx:key="index" class="row"><input value="{{item}}" data-index="{{index}}" bindinput="onPollOption" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="选项 {{index + 1}} · 最多 255 字" /><button data-index="{{index}}" bindtap="onRemovePollOption" disabled="{{frozen || busy || pollDraft.options.length &lt;= 2}}">删除</button></view>
        <button class="secondary" bindtap="onAddPollOption" disabled="{{frozen || busy || pollDraft.options.length + (pollDraft.finalOption ? 1 : 0) >= 5}}">添加普通选项</button>
        <view class="row"><text>最后添加吃瓜🍉</text><switch checked="{{pollDraft.finalOption}}" bindchange="onPollFinal" disabled="{{frozen || busy}}" /></view>
        <view class="notice">至少两个普通选项，总共最多五个；吃瓜🍉同样可被选择并占一个名额。单选点选即投，多选需要确认；每人仅可投一次，作者也可参与。本次新建投票不设截止时间。</view>
      </view>
      <view class="meta">投票、组队和内部链接只能选一个。请先关闭当前组件再切换，未提交的填写内容会保留。内部链接仍待接入。</view>
    </view>
    <view wx:if="{{canAddFormation}}" class="formation-composer">
      <view class="row"><text>添加组队</text><switch checked="{{formationDraft.enabled}}" bindchange="onFormationEnabled" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded || pollDraft.enabled}}" /></view>
      <view wx:if="{{formationDraft.enabled}}">
        <view class="label">活动主题 · 最多 12 字</view><input value="{{formationDraft.theme}}" data-field="theme" bindinput="onFormationField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="一起做什么？" />
        <view class="label">总人数 · 1–20 人，包含发起人</view><input type="number" value="{{formationDraft.capacity}}" data-field="capacity" bindinput="onFormationField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="填写整数人数，不会自动修正" />
        <view class="notice">发布成功后你会立即加入并占一个名额。{{formationDraft.capacity === '1' ? '人数设为 1，发布时即满员。' : '最后一个名额加入后即满员。'}}</view>
        <view class="label">提供给组内成员的联系方式 · 至少一项</view>
        <input value="{{formationDraft.wechat}}" data-field="wechat" bindinput="onFormationField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="微信（最多 100 UTF-8 字节）" />
        <input value="{{formationDraft.qq}}" data-field="qq" bindinput="onFormationField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="QQ（最多 50 UTF-8 字节）" />
        <input value="{{formationDraft.phone}}" data-field="phone" bindinput="onFormationField" maxlength="-1" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" placeholder="联系电话（最多 20 UTF-8 字节）" />
        <view class="formation-disclosure">以上联系方式仅供有权查看此帖的组内成员查看和复制，不会显示在普通帖子列表、详情或成员名单中。联系方式由你自行填写，不表示号码已认证，也不会从个人资料、认证手机号或交易偏好中代填。</view>
        <view class="formation-disclosure">匿名发起时，帖子和成员名单公开展示匿名形象；组内成员仍可能通过你填写的联系方式识别你的真实身份。请勿填写他人的私密资料。</view>
        <view class="row"><text>我已了解并同意以上联系方式向符合权限的组内成员提供</text><switch checked="{{formationDraft.contactConsent}}" bindchange="onFormationConsent" disabled="{{frozen || busy || !loaded}}" /></view>
      </view>
    </view>
    <view class="notice">{{mediaNotice}}</view>
    <view wx:if="{{batchMode}}" class="media-batch">
      <view wx:for="{{mediaMembers}}" wx:key="memberId" class="media-batch-member">
        <text>第 {{index + 1}} 张 · {{item.status}}</text>
        <button size="mini" data-id="{{item.memberId}}" data-direction="-1" bindtap="onMoveImage" disabled="{{frozen || busy || mediaBusy || !mediaCanEdit || index === 0}}">前移</button>
        <button size="mini" data-id="{{item.memberId}}" data-direction="1" bindtap="onMoveImage" disabled="{{frozen || busy || mediaBusy || !mediaCanEdit || index + 1 === mediaSelected}}">后移</button>
        <button size="mini" data-id="{{item.memberId}}" bindtap="onReplaceImage" disabled="{{frozen || busy || mediaBusy || !mediaCanEdit}}">替换</button>
        <button size="mini" data-id="{{item.memberId}}" bindtap="onRemoveImage" disabled="{{frozen || busy || mediaBusy || !mediaCanEdit}}">移除</button>
      </view>
      <button bindtap="onSelectImage" disabled="{{frozen || busy || mediaBusy || !canSelectImage}}">添加一张原图（{{mediaSelected}}/{{maxImages}}）</button>
      <button bindtap="onRecoverImage" disabled="{{busy || mediaBusy}}">确认整批图片状态</button>
      <button bindtap="onCancelImage" disabled="{{busy || mediaBusy}}">取消整批图片（需服务器确认）</button>
    </view>
    <view wx:elif="{{canSelectImage}}"><button bindtap="onSelectImage" disabled="{{frozen || busy || mediaBusy || (mediaStatus !== 'idle' &amp;&amp; mediaStatus !== 'terminal' &amp;&amp; mediaStatus !== 'bound_history')}}">选择一张原图并上传</button><button bindtap="onRecoverImage">查询原图片操作</button><button bindtap="onCancelImage">取消原图片操作（需服务器确认）</button></view>
    <view wx:if="{{blocker}}" class="notice">{{blocker}}</view>
    <button wx:if="{{!frozen}}" class="primary" bindtap="onSubmit" disabled="{{!canSubmit || busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">确认以上身份并发布</button><button wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="primary" bindtap="onReceipt" disabled="{{busy}}" loading="{{busy}}">查询原请求回执</button><button wx:if="{{frozen}}" class="secondary" bindtap="onRetry" disabled="{{busy}}">重试完全相同的原请求</button><button wx:if="{{busy}}" bindtap="onCancel">停止等待（不撤销发布）</button>
    <view wx:if="{{receiptStatus}}" class="status">{{receiptStatus}}</view><navigator wx:if="{{resourcePostId &amp;&amp; !resourceRootCommentId}}" class="link" url="/pages/community-detail/community-detail?postId={{resourcePostId}}">查看已确认的帖子 →</navigator><navigator wx:if="{{resourceRootCommentId &amp;&amp; resourceReplyId}}" class="link" url="/pages/community-thread/community-thread?postId={{resourcePostId}}&amp;rootCommentId={{resourceRootCommentId}}&amp;replyId={{resourceReplyId}}">查看已确认的回复 →</navigator><navigator wx:if="{{resourceRootCommentId &amp;&amp; !resourceReplyId}}" class="link" url="/pages/community-detail/community-detail?postId={{resourcePostId}}&amp;rootCommentId={{resourceRootCommentId}}">查看已确认的评论 →</navigator>
  </view>
  <button wx:if="{{!busy}}" class="secondary" bindtap="onReload">重新检查草稿与待确认记录</button><navigator wx:if="{{!hasSession}}" class="link" url="/pages/login/login">登录后继续</navigator><navigator class="link" url="/pages/community-mine/community-mine">我的发布与结果恢复 →</navigator>
  <view class="notice">关闭页面或换账号会清空页面内容，但原账号草稿与待确认请求仍保留在本机。请勿在结果未确认前清除小程序数据。</view>
</view>
